  <img class="cltp-hero-img" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/charlotte-restaurants-hero-1600.webp"
       srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/charlotte-restaurants-hero-800.webp 800w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/07/charlotte-restaurants-hero-1600.webp 1600w"
       sizes="100vw" width="1600" height="640" alt="Shared dishes and drinks on a restaurant dinner table" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
  <div class="cltp-hero-content">
  <div class="cltp-wrap">
    <h1>The Best Restaurants in Charlotte</h1>
    <p>This is CLT Daily&#8217;s always-current guide to Charlotte restaurants — the essential spots every local should know, the best places to eat in every neighborhood, brunch and breakfast favorites, date-night rooms, and the newest openings worth your money. Charlotte is a real food city now (it earned its first Michelin star in 2025), and we update this page as the scene changes — so bookmark it and check back.</p>
    <p style="font-size:.95rem;color:#C9D0DB;border-left:3px solid #E29C04;padding-left:14px;margin:0 0 24px;">Every restaurant on this page was verified open as of October 1, 2026. We re-check monthly.</p>
    <div class="cltp-hero-btns">
      <a class="cltp-btn cltp-btn--gold" href="#new">See What Just Opened ↓</a>
